###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The data set is the same DFT database as in purjapun2019 but each file declares its own data-set node (no shared data-set IRIs under the convention); the DFT settings recorded here are those this paper states for its own phonon calculations.
# - The descriptor settings (five Legendre orders, eight Gaussian positions, width 1 A, 40 features) are described in the gaps only; the test-database error is given as a figure.
# - Table I properties (lattice constant, elastic constants, defect, surface and stacking-fault energies), melting point, interface tensions, liquid structure and the grain-boundary crack simulation are not encoded. MD timings (for example 40 ps of 10,976 atoms in about 24 h on 28 cores) are not encoded.
# - Read from the arXiv v3 preprint.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

